    "details": "<h1 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"10khxsr\" data-start=\"194\" data-end=\"229\">AFFECIO HACKS &rsquo;26 &mdash; by Affecio</h1>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"231\" data-end=\"429\">Welcome to <strong data-start=\"242\" data-end=\"263\">AFFECIO HACKS &rsquo;26</strong> &mdash; an online hackathon by Affecio, bringing together students, developers, designers, innovators, and problem-solvers to turn ideas into meaningful digital solutions.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"19n6h0o\" data-start=\"431\" data-end=\"455\">About the Opportunity</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"457\" data-end=\"630\"><strong data-start=\"457\" data-end=\"478\">AFFECIO HACKS &rsquo;26</strong> is an online hackathon bringing together students and aspiring builders to solve real-world problems through technology, creativity, and collaboration.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"859\">Participants can work individually or in teams to build a functional solution during the hackathon. Teams are encouraged to experiment with modern technologies, APIs, open-source tools, frameworks, and AI tools where permitted.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"1006\">The hackathon is designed to give participants hands-on experience in <strong data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"1006\">ideation, development, problem-solving, teamwork, and product building.</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1118\">Projects will be evaluated based on <strong data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1118\">technical implementation, innovation, impact, UI/UX, and presentation.</strong></p>\n<hr data-start=\"1120\" data-end=\"1123\" />\n<h2 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"hhq73b\" data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1147\">Challenge Tracks</h2>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"1k22ics\" data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1172\">Human Connection</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1264\">Build technology that helps people connect, understand, support, and relate to one another.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"1b2rs1t\" data-start=\"1266\" data-end=\"1296\">AI &amp; Social Interaction</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1381\">Explore how AI can enable more meaningful, natural, and human-centered interactions.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"ld4cn3\" data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1401\">Communities</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1500\">Create tools that help people discover, build, and strengthen communities around shared interests.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"vbzthz\" data-start=\"1502\" data-end=\"1522\">Communication</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1622\">Reimagine how people communicate, express themselves, and build relationships in the digital world.</p>\n<blockquote data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1737\">\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1737\"><strong data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1737\">These are broad challenge themes. The actual problem statements will be revealed when the hackathon begins.</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1742\" />\n<h2 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"11trmq5\" data-start=\"1744\" data-end=\"1774\">Problem Statement Reveal</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1879\">The <strong data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1847\">official problem statements will be revealed on 21 October 2026</strong>, at the start of the hackathon.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"2024\">Participants will receive the specific challenges at the beginning of the build phase and can start working on their solutions from that point.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2095\"><strong data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2095\">No problem statement will be provided before the official reveal.</strong></p>\n<hr data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2100\" />\n<h2 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"15yhr7m\" data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2127\">️ Hackathon Timeline</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2215\"><strong data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2162\">21 October 2026 &mdash; 9:30 AM IST</strong><br data-start=\"2162\" data-end=\"2165\" /><strong data-start=\"2168\" data-end=\"2215\">Hackathon Begins + Problem Statement Reveal</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2217\" data-end=\"2260\"><strong data-start=\"2217\" data-end=\"2239\">21&ndash;28 October 2026</strong><br data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2242\" /><strong data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2260\">Build Phase</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2320\"><strong data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2295\">28 October 2026 &mdash; 9:30 PM IST</strong><br data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2298\" />⏳ <strong data-start=\"2300\" data-end=\"2320\">Build Phase Ends</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2322\" data-end=\"2394\"><strong data-start=\"2322\" data-end=\"2361\">28 October 2026 &mdash; 9:30&ndash;11:30 PM IST</strong><br data-start=\"2361\" data-end=\"2364\" /><strong data-start=\"2367\" data-end=\"2394\">Final Submission Window</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2396\" data-end=\"2436\"><strong data-start=\"2396\" data-end=\"2416\">After Submission</strong><br data-start=\"2416\" data-end=\"2419\" /><strong data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2436\">Evaluation</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2438\" data-end=\"2475\"><strong data-start=\"2441\" data-end=\"2475\">Results &amp; Winners Announcement</strong></p>\n<hr data-start=\"2477\" data-end=\"2480\" />\n<h2 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"vb7ku2\" data-start=\"2482\" data-end=\"2501\">Event Details</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2626\"><strong data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2514\">Format:</strong> Online<br data-start=\"2521\" data-end=\"2524\" /><strong data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2538\">Team Size:</strong> 1&ndash;4 members<br data-start=\"2550\" data-end=\"2553\" /><strong data-start=\"2553\" data-end=\"2571\">Participation:</strong> Free<br data-start=\"2576\" data-end=\"2579\" /><strong data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"2594\">Prize Pool:</strong> ₹10,000<br data-start=\"2602\" data-end=\"2605\" /><strong data-start=\"2605\" data-end=\"2617\">Open To:</strong> Students</p>\n<hr data-start=\"2628\" data-end=\"2631\" />\n<h2 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"jwvouz\" data-start=\"2633\" data-end=\"2659\">️ What Can You Build?</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2661\" data-end=\"2745\">Participants can use technologies and tools that best fit their solution, including:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"2747\" data-end=\"2917\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1fmnfsn\" data-start=\"2747\" data-end=\"2774\">\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2749\" data-end=\"2774\">Web &amp; mobile applications</p>\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"pqw0kk\" data-start=\"2775\" data-end=\"2792\">\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"2792\">AI/ML solutions</p>\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1wy6g2z\" data-start=\"2793\" data-end=\"2822\">\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2795\" data-end=\"2822\">APIs &amp; third-party services</p>\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"xn643w\" data-start=\"2823\" data-end=\"2849\">\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2825\" data-end=\"2849\">Open-source technologies</p>\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"en8s3c\" data-start=\"2850\" data-end=\"2869\">\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2852\" data-end=\"2869\">Modern frameworks</p>\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"h5kpud\" data-start=\"2870\" data-end=\"2887\">\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2872\" data-end=\"2887\">Cloud platforms</p>\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"odhhpb\" data-start=\"2888\" data-end=\"2917\">\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2890\" data-end=\"2917\">Other relevant technologies</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2919\" data-end=\"3055\"><strong data-start=\"2919\" data-end=\"2960\">AI tools are allowed where permitted.</strong> Participants should clearly disclose their use of AI tools in their submission where required.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"3057\" data-end=\"3060\" />\n<h2 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"1dem1q0\" data-start=\"3062\" data-end=\"3084\">Final Submission</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3086\" data-end=\"3157\">Teams must submit their completed project within the submission window.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3159\" data-end=\"3189\">The submission should include:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"3191\" data-end=\"3372\">\n<li data-section-id=\"fiv5b\" data-start=\"3191\" data-end=\"3219\">\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3193\" data-end=\"3219\">Selected problem statement</p>\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1w0ubdj\" data-start=\"3220\" data-end=\"3242\">\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3222\" data-end=\"3242\">Solution description</p>\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1n6385r\" data-start=\"3243\" data-end=\"3262\">\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3245\" data-end=\"3262\">GitHub repository</p>\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1us7tzn\" data-start=\"3263\" data-end=\"3300\">\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3265\" data-end=\"3300\">Demo/deployment link, if applicable</p>\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"fqmyd6\" data-start=\"3301\" data-end=\"3313\">\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3303\" data-end=\"3313\">Demo video</p>\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1eatlsw\" data-start=\"3314\" data-end=\"3332\">\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3316\" data-end=\"3332\">Technology stack</p>\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1fb3rm9\" data-start=\"3333\" data-end=\"3372\">\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3335\" data-end=\"3372\">Relevant AI tools used, if applicable</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3374\" data-end=\"3410\">Projects will be evaluated based on:</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3412\" data-end=\"3551\"><strong data-start=\"3412\" data-end=\"3446\">Technical Implementation &mdash; 30%</strong><br data-start=\"3446\" data-end=\"3449\" /><strong data-start=\"3449\" data-end=\"3469\">Innovation &mdash; 25%</strong><br data-start=\"3469\" data-end=\"3472\" /><strong data-start=\"3472\" data-end=\"3501\">Impact &amp; Usefulness &mdash; 20%</strong><br data-start=\"3501\" data-end=\"3504\" /><strong data-start=\"3504\" data-end=\"3519\">UI/UX &mdash; 15%</strong><br data-start=\"3519\" data-end=\"3522\" /><strong data-start=\"3522\" data-end=\"3551\">Demo &amp; Presentation &mdash; 10%</strong></p>\n<hr data-start=\"3553\" data-end=\"3556\" />\n<h2 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"8zk2uh\" data-start=\"3558\" data-end=\"3591\">Stay Connected with Affecio</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3593\" data-end=\"3789\">Important hackathon updates, announcements, reminders, the <strong data-start=\"3652\" data-end=\"3680\">Problem Statement Reveal</strong>, submission updates, results, and event highlights will also be shared through Affecio's official Instagram.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"12b2zgv\" data-start=\"3791\" data-end=\"3827\"><span role=\"text\">Follow <strong data-start=\"3802\" data-end=\"3814\">@affecio</strong> on Instagram</span></h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3829\" data-end=\"3916\">Turn on notifications so you don't miss the <strong data-start=\"3873\" data-end=\"3916\">21 October Problem Statement Reveal. ️</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3918\" data-end=\"3957\"><strong data-start=\"3921\" data-end=\"3935\">Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/affecio_official</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3959\" data-end=\"4033\"><em data-start=\"3959\" data-end=\"4033\">Important official information will also be communicated through Unstop.</em></p>\n<hr data-start=\"4035\" data-end=\"4038\" />\n<h2 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"1p3wooo\" data-start=\"4040\" data-end=\"4052\">Prizes</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"4054\" data-end=\"4135\"><strong data-start=\"4054\" data-end=\"4079\"> 1st Place &mdash; ₹5,000</strong><br data-start=\"4079\" data-end=\"4082\" /><strong data-start=\"4082\" data-end=\"4107\"> 2nd Place &mdash; ₹3,000</strong><br data-start=\"4107\" data-end=\"4110\" /><strong data-start=\"4110\" data-end=\"4135\"> 3rd Place &mdash; ₹2,000</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"4137\" data-end=\"4167\"><strong data-start=\"4137\" data-end=\"4167\">Total Prize Pool &mdash; ₹10,000</strong></p>\n<hr data-start=\"4169\" data-end=\"4172\" />\n<h2 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"1mbftnn\" data-start=\"4174\" data-end=\"4196\">️ Why Participate?</h2>\n<ul data-start=\"4198\" data-end=\"4438\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1sbt24a\" data-start=\"4198\" data-end=\"4233\">\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"4200\" data-end=\"4233\">Build a real project from scratch</p>\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"urheln\" data-start=\"4234\" data-end=\"4261\">\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"4236\" data-end=\"4261\">Solve meaningful problems</p>\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"52tps3\" data-start=\"4262\" data-end=\"4294\">\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"4264\" data-end=\"4294\">Work with a team or build solo</p>\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"pwbw1j\" data-start=\"4295\" data-end=\"4339\">\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"4297\" data-end=\"4339\">Experiment with AI and modern technologies</p>\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1y9qw57\" data-start=\"4340\" data-end=\"4363\">\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"4342\" data-end=\"4363\">Showcase your project</p>\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1def1t7\" data-start=\"4364\" data-end=\"4401\">\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"4366\" data-end=\"4401\">Connect with other student builders</p>\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"xhsptp\" data-start=\"4402\" data-end=\"4438\">\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"4404\" data-end=\"4438\">Compete for prizes and recognition</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"4440\" data-end=\"4443\" />\n<h1 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"4fkn9m\" data-start=\"4445\" data-end=\"4471\">BUILD &bull; CONNECT &bull; CREATE</h1>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"4473\" data-end=\"4531\"><strong data-start=\"4473\" data-end=\"4531\">Bring your ideas. Build something meaningful. Ship it.</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"4533\" data-end=\"4583\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"4533\" data-end=\"4554\">AFFECIO HACKS &rsquo;26</strong><br data-start=\"4554\" data-end=\"4557\" /><em data-start=\"4557\" data-end=\"4583\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Ideas build connections.</em></p>",
